OL,3,ATrump's accounts traded Nvidia shares  
OL,4,A44 times this year, records show       
OL,6,FDonald Trump's investment portfolios   
OL,7,Fhave bought or sold shares in chipmaker
OL,8,FNvidia at least 44 times this year, a  
OL,9,Freview of the US president's financial 
OL,10,Fdisclosures shows.                     
OL,12,FTrump's most recent public declarations
OL,13,Fof his investment trading show that    
OL,14,Fbetween January and September the      
OL,15,Fportfolios purchased between $5.2m and 
OL,16,F$17m (#4m and #13m) in Nvidia stock -  
OL,17,Fand sold between $4.4m and $12m. His   
OL,18,Fportfolios held between $12.5m and $58m
OL,19,Fof Nvidia shares at the end of 2025.   
