OL,3,ATrump's accounts traded Nvidia shares  
OL,4,A44 times this year, records show       
OL,6,FFinancial disclosures to the Office of 
OL,7,FGovernment Ethics report a low and high
OL,8,Frange of transaction values, so a more 
OL,9,Fprecise analysis of how much Nvidia    
OL,10,Fstock was traded is not possible.      
OL,12,FThe period of recent turmoil at Nvidia 
OL,13,Fand volatility in its share price is   
OL,14,Fnot covered by the disclosures. In the 
OL,15,Flast two weeks, co-founder and chief   
OL,16,Fexecutive Jensen Huang resigned and    
OL,17,Fthen Trump played a significant part in
OL,18,Fhis reinstatement.                     
